WEBVTT

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:08.380
This draft is good.

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:10.380
Thank you.

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:15.910
It feels like a side story for 
<i>Lunar Glasses</i>, your pro manga.

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:20.720
Well, I figured right now, I should 
focus on writing what I know.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:21.810
I see.

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:24.540
Did she get over it?

00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:28.470
So Hato-kun is
 finishing the artwork?

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:32.910
About that... we might end up coming here,

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:37.440
or to Hato-kun's room, 
to work on the art.

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:38.720
Is that okay?

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:41.220
Oh, uh...

00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:42.700
Yeah.

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:48.750
I think you're supposed to say no.

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:51.100
Am I?

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:52.050
Yes.

00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:54.350
Even if he's a trap.

00:00:54.350 --> 00:00:58.300
I figured if it was necessary, 
I should keep my mouth shut.

00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:03.770
Well, I'm sure that's what 
you think. You always...

00:01:03.770 --> 00:01:07.150
That's right... I'm supposed 
to be a strong top.

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:11.020
Ogiue-san, sit here.

00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:14.890
Okay...

00:01:20.970 --> 00:01:22.550
Is that your phone?

00:01:22.550 --> 00:01:24.250
I've got a bad feeling about this.

00:01:25.030 --> 00:01:27.570
Okay, tonight we're training!

00:01:27.570 --> 00:01:29.290
I'm sorry.

00:01:29.290 --> 00:01:32.500
No, I kind of figured this was coming.

00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:35.070
What's with your hand?

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:40.070
Well, Sue's tagging along, 
so I guess it's okay.

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:14.060
Well, it's okay, I guess.

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:17.440
I see. It is. It is. I'm glad.

00:03:17.790 --> 00:03:21.470
It's so embarrassing to have 
someone read your work.

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:23.510
I've read it a bunch of 
times! Get used to it.

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:28.540
Well, I'm still like that when 
people read my rough drafts.

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:31.120
So what did the story end up as?

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:33.210
Oh, yeah.

00:03:33.970 --> 00:03:36.040
After the Fifth
 Interdimensional Space War,

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:38.940
in the year 24,925 of the 
Earth Gregorian Calendar,

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:43.110
the generals of the Warring 
States era are reborn

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:45.120
at the military high school 
of the 382nd planet, Necrose.

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:47.240
Their school culture fair 
gets out of hand...

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:49.590
Couldn't you do without 
most of that introduction?

00:03:49.590 --> 00:03:52.600
But there's the interdimensional haunted 
house and the interdimensional music club.

00:03:52.600 --> 00:03:55.060
Those ideas seem interesting on their own,

00:03:55.060 --> 00:03:57.450
so do you really need the 
Warring States generals?

00:03:57.450 --> 00:03:59.170
I gave up.

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:01.200
You can see the details 
when it's all done.

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:02.750
...all right.

00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:04.310
So what about you?

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:06.760
We just finished the rough draft.

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:10.100
Hato-kun said she'd
 work on the art at home.

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:11.600
Hello there.

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:14.560
We were just talking about you.

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:16.060
Were you?

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:18.500
How'd the manga turn out?

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:21.880
Well...

00:04:22.640 --> 00:04:25.220
We can't put this in the magazine.

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:28.500
When I tried to draw in 
that style as a girl,

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:31.870
it turned into BL illustrations again.

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:33.690
Hato-chan, do you understand?

00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:36.430
My characters are doing it.

00:04:36.430 --> 00:04:41.010
If there was a doujinshi of my manga, 
this is what it would look like.

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:43.900
Ogi-sempai?

00:04:46.370 --> 00:04:50.750
Um, yes. Putting this aside...

00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:53.150
I want a copy of it later.

00:04:53.150 --> 00:04:54.660
Looks like you liked it!

00:04:56.370 --> 00:04:59.160
I think I need to watch as she draws,

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:03.260
so that her drawings 
don't end up as porn.

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:06.300
I really do need the help.

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:10.730
Okay, Hato-chan! We'll watch too!

00:05:10.730 --> 00:05:13.730
As you draw porn... I mean, not porn!

00:05:13.730 --> 00:05:16.470
Come on! Come on! Come on!

00:05:16.470 --> 00:05:19.280
Yajimacchi, that thing 
could've killed me.

00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:21.510
Don't bother them. We're leaving.

00:05:21.510 --> 00:05:22.840
We need to talk about our art.

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:26.260
But it sounds like so much fun!

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:25.950
Shut up! We're leaving.

00:05:27.350 --> 00:05:30.060
Okay, let's get started.

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:31.390
Yes.

00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:34.390
White Gate Keeper.

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:42.000
How did you...

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:45.130
... settle on your current style?

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:49.070
Oh, I haven't settled on it yet.

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:53.850
I've done a lot of things since I was a 
kid, like copying my favorite manga...

00:05:53.850 --> 00:05:55.930
And this is just how it turned out.

00:05:55.930 --> 00:05:57.580
Yeah, I thought so.

00:05:57.580 --> 00:06:00.710
Your style is something you develop

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:04.380
after a long period of 
trial and error, isn't it?

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:09.240
But the style in these pictures 
is just a copy of someone else.

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:12.490
Almost completely.

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:16.730
I feel so bad that I can draw 
them just by crossdressing,

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:20.000
and that it's always BL illustrations.

00:06:20.240 --> 00:06:24.420
I think that's the reason I can't 
draw normal manga in this style.

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:30.280
No, um... you're not tracing, 
right? You were just influenced.

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:31.300
Yes.

00:06:31.300 --> 00:06:33.650
Then it's not really copying.

00:06:33.650 --> 00:06:37.140
No, more importantly, 
the way you talked...

00:06:37.140 --> 00:06:40.020
...it's someone you know, right?

00:06:40.020 --> 00:06:44.650
A sempai at my high 
school was really good.

00:06:44.650 --> 00:06:45.730
She was a rotten girl.

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:51.470
High school... sempai... good 
at drawing... rotten girl...

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:55.300
Hato-kun, were you thinking of her back 
when we were talking about romance?

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:59.410
Bingo! She's gone three times as red!

00:07:00.340 --> 00:07:04.710
No, it's not really... uhm...

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:06.300
Wait a second!

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:11.510
I'm sorry, Hato-kun. I can't 
give you advice about romance.

00:07:12.420 --> 00:07:14.400
Do you think it would be okay

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:18.460
if I tried a different 
approach as a manga author?

00:07:20.890 --> 00:07:22.230
I'm pathetic.

00:07:22.230 --> 00:07:25.980
As her sempai, I need to find some 
way to solve this problem.

00:07:26.390 --> 00:07:28.380
Um...

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:33.030
I can understand not being able to draw 
normal manga for psychological reasons.

00:07:33.570 --> 00:07:37.090
It's normal for something small 
to make you incapable of drawing.

00:07:37.090 --> 00:07:37.990
Yes.

00:07:38.820 --> 00:07:43.190
Hmm... that means what 
doesn't make sense,

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:44.770
is the crossdressing.

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:49.300
It's just not possible for something 
like that to give you so much firepower.

00:07:50.170 --> 00:07:53.570
As a manga author, I can say 
for sure that it's impossible.

00:07:53.780 --> 00:07:56.820
So I think the natural assumption

00:07:56.820 --> 00:08:00.330
is that you always have that ability.

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:01.100
No...

00:08:01.530 --> 00:08:06.630
Even back when you were being my 
assistant, I was honestly a little jealous.

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:11.300
"She can draw anything.
 It's possible she's better than me."

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:14.150
No! No! That's impossible!

00:08:14.150 --> 00:08:17.100
My style when I'm a guy...

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:18.330
It's like that!

00:08:19.320 --> 00:08:23.330
That's kind of interesting 
in and of itself,

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:27.750
but what that means is that you always 
wanted to draw things like this.

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:31.610
When you're a guy, you put a 
limiter on your own abilities,

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:34.970
and the crossdressing 
gets rid of that limiter.

00:08:34.970 --> 00:08:39.470
Even if you copied the style, 
this is your own ability.

00:08:39.470 --> 00:08:43.460
I guarantee that you 
can draw a real manga.

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:45.850
Now give it a try.

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:49.350
Hey, when you're drawing 
dirty pictures...

00:08:49.350 --> 00:08:51.570
Does it make you feel horny?

00:08:51.570 --> 00:08:52.420
I don't know.

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:53.460
Do you--

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:54.490
Sorry, but I don't draw dirty pictures!

00:08:54.490 --> 00:08:55.880
<b>Society for the Study 
of Modern Visual Culture</b>

00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:03.150
You did it.

00:09:03.150 --> 00:09:04.210
Yes.

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:09.060
I think it works. Let's keep at it.

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:10.550
Y-Yeah!

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:18.220
Wow... I think this is the most 
presidential thing I've ever done!

00:09:18.710 --> 00:09:21.180
Hi there! It's the Circle 
Leadership Committee!

00:09:22.930 --> 00:09:25.100
We're here with a message.

00:09:25.100 --> 00:09:28.060
Oh, Takeya-san, did you cut your hair?

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:33.010
That's right, I registered with 
them under the name Takeya Mikako.

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:35.650
Sempai.

00:09:35.650 --> 00:09:37.330
I know.

00:09:37.330 --> 00:09:41.230
Um... it's about the costumes you're 
using for the cosplay photo shoot.

00:09:41.230 --> 00:09:43.700
We need a list, and 
pictures for all of them.

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:45.150
Here.

00:09:45.150 --> 00:09:46.280
Okay.

00:09:46.280 --> 00:09:48.240
Nothing too dirty, they said.

00:09:48.240 --> 00:09:49.900
I'll let the person in charge know.

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:52.820
So are you coming to the 
festival, Takeya-san?

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:55.340
Yes... I think.

00:09:55.340 --> 00:09:59.030
Oh, I'll show you around then!

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:01.620
As president, I need to do something!

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:02.950
Sempai. Sempai.

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:05.080
What? Shut up.

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:09.510
President Mikami asked me to 
tell him everything you did.

00:10:09.510 --> 00:10:11.870
What? You're going to rat me out?

00:10:11.870 --> 00:10:13.950
I'm not going to rat you out.

00:10:13.950 --> 00:10:17.280
I'm going to tell him
 right in front of you.

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:20.410
Do you want to suck up to him that much?

00:10:20.410 --> 00:10:24.220
If you don't make trouble, 
there won't be any problems.

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:27.050
Fine.

00:10:28.050 --> 00:10:30.940
Okay, take care of the cosplay 
thing. See you soon.

00:10:33.380 --> 00:10:34.800
Automatic writing?

00:10:35.830 --> 00:10:39.570
Hato-kun... it's just that you want 
to draw those pictures, isn't it?

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:45.340
There weren't any restrictions 
like this last year.

00:10:45.340 --> 00:10:49.850
I hear that the Circle Leadership Committee's
 president is the harshest since Kitagawa-san.

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:56.880
Yes? Hello! It's been forever!

00:10:56.880 --> 00:11:01.470
Kohsaka said he's finally 
done with a big job,

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:03.440
and he wants to go.

00:11:03.440 --> 00:11:04.410
Then...

00:11:04.410 --> 00:11:06.680
I'll be going to the school fair too.

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:10.080
I'll get your costume ready, Saki-san!

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:12.820
She hung up!

00:11:12.820 --> 00:11:14.040
Was that Kasukabe-san?

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:17.430
Everybody else is coming. 
What about you, Sasahara-san?

00:11:17.430 --> 00:11:20.700
You still aren't sure. I see.

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:23.510
Oh, the <i>Mebaetame</i> special?

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:27.910
<b>Madarame-sempai,
<i> </i>
It looks like we'll 
have the <i>Mebaetame</i>
 special done in time 
for the school fair! 
<i> </i>
- Hato</b>

00:11:44.230 --> 00:11:47.100
The Modern... what?

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:48.850
<b>Cosplay Try-On and Photo Studio - 
Society for the Study of Modern Visual Culture</b>

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:48.870
That's pretty amazing.

00:11:51.730 --> 00:11:57.690
<b>Society for the Study of 
Modern Visual Culture Cosplay</b>

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:57.690
The Society for the Study 
of Modern Visual Culture.

00:11:57.690 --> 00:12:00.190
Ogiue-san!

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:04.240
Stop asking. I told 
you I'm not doing it.

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:06.550
The situation's changed!

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:16.460
<b>Front Desk 
 Special Magazine (200 yen)</b>

00:12:06.550 --> 00:12:09.090
Saki-san's coming!

00:12:09.090 --> 00:12:13.690
If we're cosplaying, she might too!

00:12:13.690 --> 00:12:16.460
I don't think she's the type who's 
influenced by things like that.

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:19.020
Ohno-sempai looks like she's having fun.

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:22.640
I think it's only a matter of time 
before she gets us in trouble.

00:12:22.640 --> 00:12:27.290
I'm handling the makeup today,
 so I got out of having to cosplay.

00:12:27.290 --> 00:12:31.500
You said you were going to try and 
blend in, but you're wearing make-up!

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:33.620
I didn't think I could 
get by without makeup.

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:35.710
You don't look plain at all!

00:12:35.710 --> 00:12:38.160
I'm not wearing much!

00:12:38.160 --> 00:12:41.650
Listen, idiot, "plain" 
means somebody like me--

00:12:39.970 --> 00:12:43.130
Welcome! Are you interested in cosplay?

00:12:43.590 --> 00:12:45.890
Or maybe people like her.

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:47.640
Hey.

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:49.960
Mirei!

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:55.760
University's amazing.

00:12:55.760 --> 00:12:58.520
You made it here on your 
own, just like you said.

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:01.110
Why is she hiding?

00:13:01.110 --> 00:13:03.500
She called Yajima-san "Mirei"?

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:06.400
That's the friend from high 
school you mentioned, right?

00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:08.280
Yeah. Her name's Mimasaka.

00:13:08.280 --> 00:13:09.700
Say hello.

00:13:09.700 --> 00:13:12.220
H-Hi there.

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:14.010
On the left is Yoshitake.

00:13:14.010 --> 00:13:14.990
Hi there.

00:13:14.990 --> 00:13:16.940
And this is, um...

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:18.830
The one I told you about.

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:21.990
"The one I told you about," huh?

00:13:21.990 --> 00:13:24.700
Just call her Takeya today.

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:28.100
She's supposed to be a student 
from another university.

00:13:28.100 --> 00:13:30.640
And this is Ogiue-sempai, the president.

00:13:30.640 --> 00:13:31.390
Hi.

00:13:31.390 --> 00:13:33.350
I hope you have a good time.

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:36.760
She's staring at me.

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:40.130
Look! This has Yajimacchi's 
drawings in it!

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:41.270
It's 200 yen.

00:13:41.270 --> 00:13:42.540
I'll buy it!

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:46.690
Well, of course she'd look at me 
like that, since she knows who I am.

00:13:46.690 --> 00:13:49.950
You're a really good artist, Mirei.

00:13:50.530 --> 00:13:51.530
...for pity's sake.

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:55.440
Mimacchi, you don't need to be polite.

00:13:55.440 --> 00:13:56.310
Mima...?

00:13:56.310 --> 00:13:59.670
Isn't she better off 
if you tell the truth,

00:13:59.670 --> 00:14:02.040
and she learns how harsh 
the world really is?

00:14:02.040 --> 00:14:04.360
How harsh the world is?

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:07.750
Mirei learned that a long time ago!

00:14:07.750 --> 00:14:11.760
But what's so amazing about 
Mirei is that she doesn't mind.

00:14:11.760 --> 00:14:12.720
Right?

00:14:12.720 --> 00:14:15.220
Well, it's not true that I don't mind...

00:14:15.220 --> 00:14:19.280
The bond between the two of 
them is stronger than I thought.

00:14:19.280 --> 00:14:20.770
So it seems.

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:24.090
<b>Anime Research</b>

00:14:21.140 --> 00:14:24.090
He's not in the Anime 
Research club either, huh?

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:27.290
Want to go back and ask?

00:14:27.290 --> 00:14:28.530
Ask what?

00:14:28.530 --> 00:14:31.250
Is there anybody named 
Hato in the freshman year?

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:36.480
We decided that he'd be sure 
to join some otaku circle.

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:39.250
Of course he did! ...I think.

00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:41.900
You're not sure! You were 
sure but now you're not!

00:14:41.900 --> 00:14:44.090
Then I'll go back and ask!

00:14:44.090 --> 00:14:44.980
Seriously?

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:45.880
Huh?

00:14:45.880 --> 00:14:47.590
Oh? What is it?

00:14:47.590 --> 00:14:51.340
Is that Kaminaga-sempai?
  At the top of that staircase.

00:14:52.420 --> 00:14:53.760
I can't tell.

00:14:53.760 --> 00:14:54.850
I can't see her now.

00:14:54.850 --> 00:14:56.560
Wait, Kon--

00:15:14.980 --> 00:15:18.390
I just can't tell!
 There's too many people!

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:20.940
You sure it was Kaminaga-sempai?

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:24.120
What? You didn't see 
her? I'm sure it was!

00:15:24.120 --> 00:15:26.930
Well, it makes sense 
for her to be here...

00:15:28.090 --> 00:15:29.670
Cosplay?

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:33.430
That's Atelier Maru! How cute!

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:34.910
<b>Cosplay Try-On and Photo Shoot - 
Society for the Study of Modern Visual Culture.</b>

00:15:35.130 --> 00:15:36.470
Question!

00:15:36.470 --> 00:15:39.450
Which generals saw great success 
at the battle of Shizugatake,

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:43.330
but were not counted among the 
Seven Spears of Shizugatake?!

00:15:43.330 --> 00:15:46.290
Answer! Sakurai Iekazu 
and Ishikawa Kazumitsu!

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:48.800
It's said that this is because they 
were not Hideyoshi's personal retainers.

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:53.270
The Seven Spears began as an 
attempt to make his men famous!

00:15:56.710 --> 00:16:00.030
You always focus on the 
details of history.

00:16:00.030 --> 00:16:01.540
That was close.

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:04.470
It looks like you haven't been 
slacking off in your studies.

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:10.460
"Question" and "Answer"... 
isn't that from Zen Buddhism?

00:16:11.460 --> 00:16:14.100
These two are from the 
history club at my school.

00:16:14.100 --> 00:16:16.460
They're my sisters-in-arms, you might say.

00:16:16.460 --> 00:16:19.390
Quiet. On the battlefield, we're enemies.

00:16:19.390 --> 00:16:21.790
Ugh. You're not using the term right.

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:23.150
How?

00:16:23.150 --> 00:16:25.890
Brothers-in-arms are allies 
on the battlefield...

00:16:24.220 --> 00:16:27.980
So it's Yoshitake-san's friends now?

00:16:27.980 --> 00:16:30.230
It's a lot livelier in here now.

00:16:30.230 --> 00:16:32.800
Is everybody here?

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:34.990
You can't...

00:16:34.990 --> 00:16:37.030
All set.

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:40.410
I had sempai make these for me.

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:43.040
It had to be this game, didn't it?

00:16:43.040 --> 00:16:45.400
You look so good in that! {I think this is samurai warriors.  Good game.}

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:48.400
Ohno-sempai is seriously merciless.

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:51.230
You look so cool, Mirei.  {OK that's not samurai warriors.  What the hell is that.}{Oh god, is that H-game where the Sengoku warlords are all hawt chicks, and you're a dude who's gonna bang them all to unify Japan.}

00:16:51.230 --> 00:16:53.660
The stomach area is made 
from stockings too.

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:55.460
Wow, it's really lively in here.

00:16:55.460 --> 00:16:57.200
Oh, Madarame-sempai!

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:58.360
Hey.

00:16:58.360 --> 00:16:59.510
Hey.

00:17:02.160 --> 00:17:06.460
This is totally a cosplay 
research club now, isn't it?

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:08.230
It is.

00:17:08.230 --> 00:17:11.650
It's like a reunion for 
Yoshitake-san and her friends.

00:17:11.650 --> 00:17:13.800
I see.

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:15.720
Is that the <i>Mebaetame</i> 
you were talking about?

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:17.890
Yes.

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:20.280
It's the special school fair edition.

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:26.570
Oh, is the manga at the front yours?

00:17:26.570 --> 00:17:30.400
Just the drawings... 
Ogiue-sempai did the story.

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:33.430
This is really amazing. Right, Ogiue-san?

00:17:33.430 --> 00:17:34.800
It really is.

00:17:34.800 --> 00:17:39.370
Ooh, this is really good.  
Really interesting.

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:42.250
It's thanks to Ogiue-sempai.

00:17:42.250 --> 00:17:44.080
He came...

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:47.770
But the atmosphere here probably 
makes it hard for him.

00:17:47.770 --> 00:17:52.610
Tanaka-sempai and Kugayama-sempai 
are here, so it's probably okay.

00:17:52.610 --> 00:17:55.280
But today, no matter what...

00:17:55.280 --> 00:17:58.470
Kasukabe-sempai and 
Kohsaka-sempai are coming.

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:03.160
It would be weird if I 
asked if he knew that.

00:18:10.080 --> 00:18:13.000
Hey, Watanabe, Onee-chan.

00:18:14.170 --> 00:18:16.760
Are Saki-neesan and 
Kohsaka-san here already?

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:21.720
What? Are those two coming?

00:18:21.720 --> 00:18:24.540
Yes. So I've heard.

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:26.830
That's why I came.

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:30.020
Who are you? And where do 
you get off saying that?

00:18:30.020 --> 00:18:32.150
Watanabe? Onee-chan?

00:18:32.150 --> 00:18:34.490
Heh heh... well?

00:18:34.490 --> 00:18:36.090
Well, what?

00:18:36.090 --> 00:18:38.930
Well, those two are coming. 
What are you going to do?

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:40.030
Nothing!

00:18:40.030 --> 00:18:43.170
From what she said... does she know?

00:18:43.170 --> 00:18:45.870
About Madarame-sempai 
and Kasukabe-sempai...

00:18:45.870 --> 00:18:49.510
And sempai seems to know it too.

00:18:49.510 --> 00:18:53.980
I wasn't the only one who knew?

00:18:55.190 --> 00:18:57.550
Huh? Huh, huh, <i>huh</i>?

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:02.090
Are the two of you dating?

00:19:02.090 --> 00:19:04.650
No, no, no! No way!

00:19:04.650 --> 00:19:07.150
Seriously? You'd make a great couple!

00:19:07.150 --> 00:19:09.940
She was totally glaring at me!

00:19:09.940 --> 00:19:12.140
Was I?

00:19:12.140 --> 00:19:15.610
That's because she's never 
seen somebody like you before.

00:19:15.610 --> 00:19:17.570
It's physically impossible.

00:19:18.650 --> 00:19:21.840
Huh? What? I don't know what you mean.

00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:24.160
Well, I'll tell you later.

00:19:24.160 --> 00:19:29.660
Physically... that's right.  
We're the weird ones.

00:19:29.660 --> 00:19:34.340
Never mind then. I'll go 
wander around for a bit.

00:19:34.340 --> 00:19:35.710
See you later.

00:19:37.650 --> 00:19:39.850
That's Sasahara's little sister.

00:19:39.850 --> 00:19:41.600
And she's a cabaret girl.

00:19:41.600 --> 00:19:45.710
She's not even a student, but she 
claims to be part of Genshiken.

00:19:45.710 --> 00:19:47.930
I think she's younger than Ogiue-san?

00:19:47.930 --> 00:19:50.480
Yes. One year younger, I think.

00:19:50.480 --> 00:19:53.050
Then a year older than me?

00:19:53.050 --> 00:19:57.750
Wait a second. Is Madarame and 
Kasukabe something everybody knows about?

00:19:57.750 --> 00:20:01.780
Of course. It's from before 
I came to university,

00:20:01.780 --> 00:20:05.160
so of course they'd know 
more about it than I would.

00:20:06.230 --> 00:20:08.490
But somehow...

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:15.340
It's cosplay everywhere.

00:20:15.340 --> 00:20:17.170
You think it's really a cosplay club?

00:20:17.170 --> 00:20:19.590
But look, they've got manga drawings up.

00:20:19.590 --> 00:20:23.000
Konno-san and Fuji-san?

00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:25.010
Crap! Oh, crap!

00:20:25.010 --> 00:20:27.830
They look just like 
Kaminaga-sempai's drawings.

00:20:31.860 --> 00:20:34.960
It's okay. They won't find out.

00:20:35.230 --> 00:20:38.440
There's no way they'll think 
I'm dressed as a girl.

00:20:38.440 --> 00:20:40.750
My voice is much cuter now.

00:20:40.750 --> 00:20:42.390
Can I look at this?

00:20:42.390 --> 00:20:44.390
Yes, go ahead.

00:20:47.280 --> 00:20:48.380
Well?

00:20:48.380 --> 00:20:53.460
Here it is. But it says they 
were drawn by Takeya Mikako.

00:20:53.460 --> 00:20:57.220
That's right. Right 
now, I'm Takeya Mikako.

00:20:57.220 --> 00:20:59.940
Hato Kenjiro isn't here.

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:03.240
Oh, Hato-chan!

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:05.720
Why are you back to dressing like that?

00:21:12.060 --> 00:21:13.100
Huh?

00:21:15.430 --> 00:21:17.100
Kamina--

00:23:01.380 --> 00:23:04.450
Damn it! Why do you always 
show up when I'm eating!

00:23:04.450 --> 00:23:08.250
I think you just eat too much.

00:23:08.250 --> 00:23:09.760
Was that deliberate?

00:23:10.070 --> 00:23:13.320
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:10.520 --> 00:23:13.320
Keiko-san, you keep getting 
Madarame-sempai's name wrong.

00:23:13.320 --> 00:23:16.700
But I thought it was Watanabe at first.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:18.750
She never figured it 
out on the first try.

00:23:18.750 --> 00:23:21.250
And I got sick of explaining it.

00:23:21.250 --> 00:23:23.250
And he can change his 
name if he gets married.

00:23:23.250 --> 00:23:23.980
Married?

00:23:23.980 --> 00:23:26.090
A lot of my friends are already married.

00:23:26.090 --> 00:23:27.710
They seem like people 
who'd do that fast.

00:23:27.710 --> 00:23:29.680
They're fast in a lot of ways, I'm sure.

00:23:29.680 --> 00:23:32.340
Are you going to change 
it to... Kasukabe?

00:23:33.180 --> 00:23:36.310
Are you going to be 
Sasahara Chika, Oneechan?

00:23:36.310 --> 00:23:39.280
Next time on <i>Genshiken: Second Generation:</i> 
Snow Man.
